          <a href="#extending-life" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Getting Ten Years Instead of Three</a>
          <a href="#verdict" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. The Short Version</a>
